From: Till Heinzerling <1684934+hoinzy@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 30 Jul 2026 23:52:19 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] virtual-media: browse images on SMB and NFS shares

Add a share URI workflow to legacy virtual media. The UI can refresh the supported top-level image list through the OpenBMC OEM action, select an image, and attach it through the standard InsertMedia action. Keep the complete image URI field available for direct use.

Upstream-Status: Pending
Signed-off-by: Till Heinzerling <1684934+hoinzy@users.noreply.github.com>
